@startuml part1_complaint_assignment_flow
actor Resident
actor Staff
participant API
database DB

== 1. Complaint submission ==
Resident -> API: POST /complaints
alt missing required fields
  API --> Resident: 400 Missing/malformed fields
else valid
  API -> DB: Save new complaint with status Open
  API -> DB: Record progress log entry for Open status
end

== 2. Auto-assignment ==
alt no assignment rule found or invalid refs
  API --> Resident: 422 Validation failed (invalid refs)
else slot available
  API -> DB: Create assignment record with Pending Acceptance status
  API -> DB: Send notification to primary staff
  API --> Resident: 201 Created (status=Open, assignmentStatus=Pending Acceptance)
else no slot available
  API -> DB: Create escalation record for the complaint
  API -> DB: Mark complaint status as Escalated
  API -> DB: Record progress log entry for Escalated status
  API --> Resident: 201 Created (status=Escalated)
end

== 3. Staff accepts ==
Staff -> API: PATCH /complaints/{id}/assignments/{aid}/accept
alt assignment not Pending Acceptance
  API --> Staff: 422 Assignment no longer Pending Acceptance
else assignment not owned by staff
  API --> Staff: 403 Assignment does not belong to staff
else valid
  API -> DB: Mark assignment as Active and record accepted date
  API -> DB: Mark availability slot as booked
  API -> DB: Update complaint status to Assigned
  API -> DB: Record progress log entry for Assigned status
  API -> DB: Notify resident and admin
  API --> Staff: 200 OK
end

== 4. Staff denies → fallback / escalation ==
Staff -> API: PATCH /complaints/{id}/assignments/{aid}/deny
alt assignment not Pending Acceptance
  API --> Staff: 422 Assignment no longer Pending Acceptance
else valid
  API -> DB: Mark assignment as Denied and save denial reason
  alt fallback_staff_id exists & has free slot
    API -> DB: Create new assignment for fallback staff with Pending Acceptance status
    API -> DB: Notify fallback staff
    API --> Staff: 200 OK (Offer sent to fallback staff)
  else fallback also denied / unavailable
    API -> DB: Create escalation record for the complaint
    API -> DB: Mark complaint status as Escalated
    API -> DB: Record progress log entry for Escalated status
    API -> DB: Notify senior admin and resident
    API --> Staff: 200 OK (Escalated — no staff accepted)
  end
end
@enduml